   "start": 20.24,
   "dur": 5.592,
   "speechStart": 20.338,
   "speechEnd": 24.978
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "如果没有，钱又是从哪里漏出去的？",
   "spoken": "如果没有，钱又是从哪里漏出去的？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg1-05.mp3",
   "start": 26.332,
   "dur": 3.912,
   "speechStart": 26.43,
   "speechEnd": 29.418
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "这一集是整个系列的入口。我们要回答三个问题。",
   "spoken": "这一集是整个系列的入口。我们要回答三个问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg1-06.mp3",
   "start": 30.744,
   "dur": 4.536,
   "speechStart": 30.842,
   "speechEnd": 34.446
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
